al world where your hand-to-hand combat skills are pushed to the limit. Your objective? Slap your opponents with lightning-fast speed and precision.\n\n- Engage in slap battles across a range of dynamic environments.\n- Choose from a diverse roster of characters, each with their own unique slapping style and personality.\n- Feel the impact of every slap as the virtual environment reacts to your actions, creating an intense and thrilling gameplay experience.", "short_description": "SlapFIGHT CHAMPIONSHIP VR is an exhilarating virtual reality (VR) game that puts your reflexes to the test. Step into an immersive virtual world where your hand-to-hand combat skills are pushed to the limit. Your objective? Slap your opponents with lightning-fast speed and precision."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/0e2430c3-f9b0-41aa-98d9-02c9cff21b66", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Eviar Pakistan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.eviarpakistan.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "337640608697920"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974631_817737449998365_5557314878682292533_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a